# Commands our static binaries run (crates/gh0st*), and what checks use.
# Each must resolve in the image; the gh0st deb's Depends bring them.
nmcli
# The hotspot's clients, and Wi-Fi power saving.
iw
wpctl
bluetoothctl
rfkill
pkexec
systemctl
timedatectl
hostnamectl
journalctl
vcgencmd
passwd
# The helper, for first-boot setup's user-create.
useradd
usermod
chpasswd
reboot
poweroff
/usr/sbin/unix_chkpwd
# sudo's askpass helper, our gh0st under another name (docs/isolation.md).
/usr/bin/gh0st-askpass
/bin/sh
xdg-user-dirs-update
ss
pactl
# System sounds: the shell feeds raw samples to one pacat.
pacat
ffmpeg
ffprobe
# Files: archives, and servers over SSH.
bsdtar
ssh
ssh-keygen
# The Store's engine: downloads, the app list's signature, deb checks.
curl
sqv
sha256sum
dpkg-deb
